N W3&quot;, Meiryo, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 1px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\">2</span><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(99, 103, 103); font-family: Overpass, &quot;Noto Sans JP&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;ヒラギノ角ゴ ProN W3&quot;, Meiryo, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 1px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">周年を記念して</span><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(99, 103, 103); font-family: Overpass, &quot;Noto Sans JP&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;ヒラギノ角ゴ ProN W3&quot;, Meiryo, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 1px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">けやき坂46時代の</span></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; caret-color: rgb(99, 103, 103); color: rgb(99, 103, 103); font-family: Overpass, &quot;Noto Sans JP&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;ヒラギノ角ゴ ProN W3&quot;, Meiryo, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 1px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br></span></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; caret-color: rgb(99, 103, 103); color: rgb(99, 103, 103); font-family: Overpass, &quot;Noto Sans JP&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;ヒラギノ角ゴ ProN W3&quot;, Meiryo, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 1px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br></span></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; caret-color: rgb(99, 103, 103); color: rgb(99, 103, 103); font-family: Overpass, &quot;Noto Sans JP&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;ヒラギノ角ゴ ProN W3&quot;, Meiryo, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 1px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br></span></div><div>　</div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div